{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>前TVB新聞主播余浩宗（Cyrus）2016年因為眼紅紅報新聞而見報，離巢後完全擺脫以往書生形象，突然留鬚兼狂操肌。近年他轉行做歐洲名牌代購生意，生活質素幾級跳，變得超級富貴！日前（8日），Cyrus開心拍片瘋狂開箱過萬美元的CHANEL新袋，平時又經常孖同性密友兼帶愛犬於名店試衫，盡顯VVIP的奢華氣派。</p><figure><img alt=\"2016年，余浩宗因眼紅紅報新聞引起觀眾注意，他事後解畫指，眼紅只因工作進入倒數階段而感觸及感動。（TVB）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241001/917619646532685824167258.jpeg/6ftdZtJAuucbm3XaYBr5169WSAoU0rtng6bwM4Om8DM\"/><figcaption>2016年，余浩宗因眼紅紅報新聞引起觀眾注意，他事後解畫指，眼紅只因工作進入倒數階段而感觸及感動。（TVB）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"余浩宗操得一身健碩身型。（IG@cyrus_yuu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241001/917621774345048064754619.jpeg/WdWUVTzaskBEQQASLNkNwXl1Y0lx_whaMmf-pTJn_qU\"/><figcaption>余浩宗操得一身健碩身型。（IG@cyrus_yuu）</figcaption></figure><p>開箱綠色鱷魚壓紋袋 豪晒15萬「機場包」</p><p>Cyrus在家中穿上CHANEL針織冷衫拍片開箱CHANEL新袋，影片畫面中打上細字「Chanel by Matthieu Blazy Unboxing Recent obsession」。他隨後發文寫道：「🪐Chanel Maxi Flap embossed croc Much needed #chanel #matthieublazy #thankyouangel #maxiflap」。據知這款綠色鱷魚壓紋小牛皮手袋，是Chanel 2026秋冬系列最新推出的Maxi Flap Bag（俗稱機場包），定價高達10,400美元（折合約81,120港元）。</p><p>其實他對這款袋情有獨鍾，早在今年3月，他已率先以約74,400港元購入CHANEL 26S系列黑色荔枝紋Maxi Flap Bag。單是這兩款同款不同色的手袋總值已超過15萬港元，行頭極度奢華。</p><figure><img alt=\"余浩宗開箱CHANEL手袋。（IG@cyrus_yuu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261108/1196234872344285184856913.png/cLz0S3R-qp7YyxQNcsKryYqOT5SekQkfa-MGq2vjBqs\"/><figcaption>余浩宗開箱CHANEL手袋。（IG@cyrus_yuu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"抱住愛犬一齊開箱。（IG@cyrus_yuu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261108/1196234869802405888342501.png/HnKIGrk2U8Q2upf5vPNI-HI37nVLnFKebjcsXG43LFw\"/><figcaption>抱住愛犬一齊開箱。（IG@cyrus_yuu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"兩個袋約15萬港元。（IG@cyrus_yuu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261108/1196234867180834816570931.png/edM7hfjmE2TNqmC-g5GW9w1Iz8N7-9mkH5rZPx-a2T8\"/><figcaption>兩個袋約15萬港元。（IG@cyrus_yuu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"今年3月開箱另一款袋。（IG@cyrus_yuu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261108/1196235034978160640631984.png/uLjh_yP-WCtCLCBIC6W2iUlwlGiz5gGFbq5oxG6uaMQ\"/><figcaption>今年3月開箱另一款袋。（IG@cyrus_yuu）</figcaption></figure><p>孖密友外遊掃貨 帶愛犬踩入名牌店</p><p>Cyrus出入經常有同性密友相伴，全身上下動輒都是LV、GUCCI等頂級名牌衣著打扮。今年8月，他與密友外遊時，亦雙雙到CHANEL名店試衫掃貨，當時他已揹着另一款CHANEL手袋出巡，十分搶眼。此外，Cyrus更獲得名店的高級待遇。在7月時，他帶埋愛犬直接踩入CHANEL專門店盡情試衫，影片中更寫上「Shopping at Chanel with my poodle」，生活極之富貴寫意。</p><figure><img alt=\"去名店試衫。（IG@cyrus_yuu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261108/1196238324067864576024769.png/Rs0nNskOHbsH3gD9fhVlimF9vLxIKb099e4KnvXuCp4\"/><figcaption>去名店試衫。（IG@cyrus_yuu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"帶埋愛犬。（IG@cyrus_yuu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261108/1196238321689563136463710.png/X7BItZzlBbgcWcwREOqE_uu-kcPXyj6NoC_6kqAv-pI\"/><figcaption>帶埋愛犬。（IG@cyrus_yuu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"跟同性密友形影不離。（IG@cyrus_yuu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261108/1196238319302873088927038.png/fdcuY37NcKWfHKoPndL7qwZWzSXmO6HjLGnlESxp5RE\"/><figcaption>跟同性密友形影不離。（IG@cyrus_yuu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一齊試衫，愛犬周圍走。（IG@cyrus_yuu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261108/1196238316740022272576401.png/SHTVid8aO8gRwrz-OXlUoBLufL0ljnl40WPiZtFj4mY\"/><figcaption>一齊試衫，愛犬周圍走。（IG@cyrus_yuu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"帶埋愛犬入名店Shopping。（IG@cyrus_yuu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261108/1196238545061154816215340.png/P_QuRy4Swrh0ljOHDKyP2Ib9YjySww9I0NWRstDVkbI\"/><figcaption>帶埋愛犬入名店Shopping。（IG@cyrus_yuu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"帶埋愛犬入名店Shopping。（IG@cyrus_yuu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261108/1196238547456233472813574.png/gnEpsCyJRfPWIclZEvCtOzVpPX6rDvfxmsr6eZrK-nk\"/><figcaption>帶埋愛犬入名店Shopping。（IG@cyrus_yuu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"帶埋愛犬入名店Shopping。（IG@cyrus_yuu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261108/1196238552057647104345607.png/TdSY1Hwyft_LSnbyL_LrREf7lDgxDPikGcmjGhnJoxo\"/><figcaption>帶埋愛犬入名店Shopping。（IG@cyrus_yuu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"帶埋愛犬入名店Shopping。（IG@cyrus_yuu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261108/1196238542188056576657380.png/5xaE0I8sKL4jxCQkUDM2AJhxRWEXYyT-1esRjNXrEYw\"/><figcaption>帶埋愛犬入名店Shopping。（IG@cyrus_yuu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"帶埋愛犬入名店Shopping。（IG@cyrus_yuu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261108/1196238549796786176318902.png/ckumjo19G5t_D5XtAYB5X2bfZPZSn7wMvzeArL83gKw\"/><figcaption>帶埋愛犬入名店Shopping。（IG@cyrus_yuu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"外遊都係行名店。（IG@cyrus_yuu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261108/1196239068438990848356480.png/cg4Jeqib2XkmEAlbwJeOXZOKkOCFb7X3Ry_tnUcv7Z0\"/><figcaption>外遊都係行名店。（IG@cyrus_yuu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"又有戰利品。（IG@cyrus_yuu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261108/1196239073510166528601723.png/SedQ95THa57z6l1HRYNkSFsRlLntEg4feyIxyHsiMcg\"/><figcaption>又有戰利品。（IG@cyrus_yuu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"潮人打扮。（IG@cyrus_yuu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261108/1196239071089922048198270.png/zLivm_R-2g6j0pKtvpzDgdvRD7f4XT2Emt9YcZrfWHE\"/><figcaption>潮人打扮。（IG@cyrus_yuu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"前TVB新聞主播余浩宗變潮男，跟同性密友結伴旅遊。（IG@cyrus_yuu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261108/1196239243735732224923875.png/p5KE6EoXLnLtqpjRmNKVFnCqiehxkJid9EmxvfRJsb0\"/><figcaption>前TVB新聞主播余浩宗變潮男，跟同性密友結伴旅遊。（IG@cyrus_yuu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"前TVB新聞主播余浩宗變潮男，跟同性密友結伴旅遊。（IG@cyrus_yuu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261108/1196239246189531136586742.png/-Ea6OYYPqmVwEAdwOS3FE5nqHhJsezbcEXNgbxFzYG8\"/><figcaption>前TVB新聞主播余浩宗變潮男，跟同性密友結伴旅遊。（IG@cyrus_yuu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"前TVB新聞主播余浩宗變潮男，跟同性密友結伴旅遊。（IG@cyrus_yuu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261108/1196239248492335104148279.png/OfcqzYgal4mrFVDvluA_tXcZSLer8THBAemJoAHpiaA\"/><figcaption>前TVB新聞主播余浩宗變潮男，跟同性密友結伴旅遊。（IG@cyrus_yuu）</figcaption></figure><p>Threads寸爆旅遊達人：得閒上嚟借袋影相</p><p>除了富貴生活備受注目，Cyrus早前在Threads上疑發炮寸爆有「旅遊達人」之稱的Jerry.C（謝利）。他不點名嘲諷對方「扮坐business class去prove自己」十分可悲，透露對方曾無端傳WhatsApp攻擊他，Cyrus當時神回：「你心地都幾差㗎喎」。他怒斥對方存在感「靠消費人哋過活」，並霸氣狂寸：「Btw, 我舖頭長期好多名牌袋，得閒上嚟借俾你影吓相。」其後他再公開單打兼狙擊對方YouTube只有1K Views，新仇舊恨一齊計。</p><figure><img alt=\"余浩宗經營歐洲名牌代購生意。（IG@kopaluxhk）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241001/917620480574230528462078.jpeg/EkIDxs9KSIy63gvPQ9h8AUlvSqUjMU-mzWR1Cs1kdQo\"/><figcaption>余浩宗經營歐洲名牌代購生意。（IG@kopaluxhk）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Jerry.C謝利有「旅遊達人」稱號。（IG@jerryctravel）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241001/917625406314647552512049.jpeg/Ti4-ikpULjLZtQ3rOjv74R2Hb7w65DKVrZJv962Sb_c\"/><figcaption>Jerry.C謝利有「旅遊達人」稱號。（IG@jerryctravel）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"其實余浩宗之前已試過開名寸Jerry.C疑似買views。（IG@cyrus_yuu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241001/917624103404310528960473.jpeg/Hhv8RhKnpwOFdoJ9Gb2vkWO4e-xMN3C-r4OYpq-DmKY\"/><figcaption>其實余浩宗之前已試過開名寸Jerry.C疑似買views。（IG@cyrus_yuu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"余浩宗生活奢華。（IG@cyrus_yuu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261108/1196239534237421568367054.jpeg/BucuyqfruQOtFHmwQYc873MaGZLWp0a9K3eEIyt3hCM\"/><figcaption>余浩宗生活奢華。（IG@cyrus_yuu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"余浩宗生活奢華。（IG@cyrus_yuu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261108/1196239536657666048150924.jpeg/224Ihp_I81oV-Wu8IdD9M7Ql2arQP3G-UWOyOVFjsjk\"/><figcaption>余浩宗生活奢華。（IG@cyrus_yuu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"余浩宗生活奢華。（IG@cyrus_yuu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261108/1196239539035967488351407.jpeg/Rn8Cs4w-M3v6-JVeKCJAXR8Bwc93nNGvMiIIcjIiCHI\"/><figcaption>余浩宗生活奢華。（IG@cyrus_yuu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"童年照。（IG@cyrus_yuu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261108/1196239541561069568927608.jpeg/JFnSs8U0G9EcAHfO9JaHaNxN2F0ASP1wvmn_fL5p_3w\"/><figcaption>童年照。（IG@cyrus_yuu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"童年照。（IG@cyrus_yuu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261108/1196239543939371008875291.jpeg/AJotaGQGndibw-kUnQEY9vV1VivhNFseLj2uFC49rhQ\"/><figcaption>童年照。（IG@cyrus_yuu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"最愛試靚衫。（IG@cyrus_yuu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261108/1196239537827745792832570.jpeg/1qecJTIwLv3yNn3s6OAo6YmNpsntFFw4a9Z092vWdPc\"/><figcaption>最愛試靚衫。（IG@cyrus_yuu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"最愛試靚衫。（IG@cyrus_yuu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261108/1196239540780666880521087.jpeg/ERRKp3COhyIIuDK05C1XZ3yxG2In2bLvugnJm7oJyZs\"/><figcaption>最愛試靚衫。（IG@cyrus_yuu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"穿中性服裝。（IG@cyrus_yuu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261108/1196239544064937984897356.png/JOZlDBRfqKhRIZ61vEz6BYKX42ZyeqcPZtlyH2bZch8\"/><figcaption>穿中性服裝。（IG@cyrus_yuu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"穿中性服裝。（IG@cyrus_yuu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261108/1196239546715869184634072.png/QjHyRKmPJ2HBdBNMtuVvi22FBL2ylA9HFnPTshZz07I\"/><figcaption>穿中性服裝。（IG@cyrus_yuu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"跟密友經常合照。（IG@cyrus_yuu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261108/1196239549001895936754816.jpeg/Uhv2ValAU2sRApXnHi34hMrs_JSnvYAZbfwUHW38FB0\"/><figcaption>跟密友經常合照。（IG@cyrus_yuu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"跟密友經常合照。（IG@cyrus_yuu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261108/1196239534476496896925781.png/dPPoowveAiq9H3qSNGpEWBG8xnoopEWJrFk0xaxZNMU\"/><figcaption>跟密友經常合照。（IG@cyrus_yuu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"跟密友經常合照。（IG@cyrus_yuu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261108/1196239536926101504283065.png/75Gk8MaI6C6KcFcdsf2dVf63s6JzDp5IBoj8mAaI_Jg\"/><figcaption>跟密友經常合照。（IG@cyrus_yuu）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T02:18:03.197074+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2006,"images":36,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T02:00:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T05:54:01.622804+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T02:11:19.901981+00:00","content_hash":"0c121d382664e229c27bcb81315f53a64cb1d8548c5696a30ca39de34b8a40dd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}